2 Quick Start
*************

Once the package is on your ‘load-path’ and ‘(require 'mab-org)’ has
been evaluated, the three most common entry points are:

‘M-x mab-org-create-project’
     Stamp out a new ‘mab<NUMBER>/mab<NUMBER>.org’ project file from the
     built-in template.

‘M-x mab-org-wrap-citekey’
     With point on a citekey or ‘[cite:@KEY]’ in any buffer, replace the
     citekey with the wrapped LaTeX block, create the per-citekey note,
     and open it.

‘M-x mab-org-add-bib-item’
     From the ‘ebib’ index buffer, append the wrapped block for the
     current entry to the configured mab project file.  Bound to ‘B’ in
     ‘ebib-index-mode-map’ once ‘ebib’ is loaded.


