6 Project Template
******************

The built-in project template lives inside ‘mab-org.el’ as the constant
‘mab-org--template-string’.  A reference copy ships in ‘mabXXXX.org’ so
you can preview the output before generating a new project file.

   ‘mab-org-create-project’ performs five substitutions in the template:

Placeholder               Source
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Document title            Project number plus project tag
Running header            Project number plus project full title
Sub-directory             ‘mab<PROJECT-NUMBER>/’
File name                 ‘mab<PROJECT-NUMBER>.org’
‘\bibliography{}’         ‘mab-org-global-bib-file’ without the ‘.bib’
                          suffix


