11 Compatibility
****************

Tested with Emacs 27.1 and later.  ‘bibtex.el’ is the only required
dependency.  ‘citar’ is optional and is only used when the wrapper
commands need to copy a BibTeX entry into the project ‘.bib’ file.
‘ebib’ is optional and is only used by ‘mab-org-add-bib-item’; the key
binding registration is gated on ‘(eval-after-load 'ebib ...)’.


